1
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:13,830
Trades lists every open position. Here, one client account's positions.

2
00:00:13,930 --> 00:00:19,540
Right-click a position to set its stop or limit, close it or hedge it.

3
00:00:19,640 --> 00:00:27,940
Stop sets the stop loss. Type a rate, or a distance in points; the projected loss is shown.

4
00:00:28,040 --> 00:00:35,310
The stop shows in the Stop column.

5
00:00:35,410 --> 00:00:43,300
Limit sets the take profit the same way.

6
00:00:43,400 --> 00:00:50,670
And the limit in the Limit column.

7
00:00:50,770 --> 00:01:00,220
Trailing Stop sets a stop that follows the price at a fixed distance.

8
00:01:00,320 --> 00:01:09,310
Close Position closes it for the client: all of it, or part, at the current rate or a rate you set.

9
00:01:09,410 --> 00:01:12,810
The position is closed and leaves the list.

